<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "any party may apply to the High Court for the costs to be taxed where an arbitral tribunal has in its award directed that costs and expenses be paid by any party, but fails to specify the amount of such costs and expenses within thirty days of having being requested to do so; or"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "c" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
