<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_3__cl_15__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Unless otherwise agreed by the parties, any party who intends to challenge an arbitrator shall, within fifteen days after becoming aware of the constitution of the arbitral tribunal or of any reasons referred to in subsection 14(3), send a written statement of the reasons for the challenge to the arbitral tribunal."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
