<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_3__cl_16__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where an arbitrator becomes in law or in fact unable to perform the functions of that office, or for other reasons fails to act without undue delay, that arbitrator's mandate terminates on withdrawal from office or if the parties agree on the termination."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
