<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_30__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_30__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Failing any agreement under subsection (2), the arbitral tribunal shall apply the law determined by the conflict of laws rules."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_30__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_30> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_30__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_30__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_30__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The arbitral tribunal shall, in all cases, decide in accordance with the terms of the agreement and shall take into account the usages of the trade applicable to the transaction. Decision making by panel of arbitrators"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
