<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_35__subsec_1__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_35__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
