<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_35__subsec_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_35__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "The provisions of section 33 shall apply to a correction or interpretation of the award or to an additional award. An award is final and binding"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
