<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_36__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_36__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "An award made by an arbitral tribunal pursuant to an arbitration agreement shall be final and binding on the parties and may be relied upon by any party by way of defence, set-off or otherwise in any proceedings in any court."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_36__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_36> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_36__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_36__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_II__chp_6__cl_36__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The arbitral tribunal shall not vary, amend, correct, review, add to or revoke an award which has been made except as specifically provided for in section 35."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
