<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_IV__cl_50__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_IV__cl_50__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the arbitral proceedings were commenced before the coming into operation of this Act, the law governing the arbitration agreement and the arbitral proceedings shall be the law which would have applied as if this Act had not been enacted."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_IV__cl_50__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_IV__cl_50> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
