<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_IV__cl_50__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@/~part_IV__cl_50__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Nothing in this Act shall affect any proceedings relating to arbitration which have been commenced in any court before the coming into operation of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/30/eng@> .
